    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve unique buoyancy based puzzles in Float Your Goat! Construct rafts to protect your unlikely hero and sometimes his friends from their worst enemy... water.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create strange and wonderous rafts, that still float!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/68f013c68587b50ec66b67dfe15063ea.poster.avif?t=1755425431\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/68f013c68587b50ec66b67dfe15063ea.webm?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/68f013c68587b50ec66b67dfe15063ea.mp4?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use creativity to come up with  wild rafts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As well as thoroughly engineered ones!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/c1a2e9490e29c8642d8f9cd573deac71.poster.avif?t=1755425431\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/c1a2e9490e29c8642d8f9cd573deac71.webm?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/c1a2e9490e29c8642d8f9cd573deac71.mp4?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your engineering skills to work as you tackle <strong>50+ levels</strong> of increasing difficulty with a variety of materials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Then Float your Goat!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/52b6c6ff48627d12ba312a93f7bd9b3a.poster.avif?t=1755425431\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/52b6c6ff48627d12ba312a93f7bd9b3a.webm?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/52b6c6ff48627d12ba312a93f7bd9b3a.mp4?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail and voyage across the seas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Possibilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level can be completed in countless ways, have endless fun exploring multiple solutions and constructions for every level.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve unique buoyancy based puzzles in Float Your Goat! Construct rafts to protect your unlikely hero and sometimes his friends from their worst enemy... water.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create strange and wonderous rafts, that still float!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/68f013c68587b50ec66b67dfe15063ea.poster.avif?t=1755425431\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/68f013c68587b50ec66b67dfe15063ea.webm?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/68f013c68587b50ec66b67dfe15063ea.mp4?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use creativity to come up with  wild rafts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As well as thoroughly engineered ones!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/c1a2e9490e29c8642d8f9cd573deac71.poster.avif?t=1755425431\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/c1a2e9490e29c8642d8f9cd573deac71.webm?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/c1a2e9490e29c8642d8f9cd573deac71.mp4?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your engineering skills to work as you tackle <strong>50+ levels</strong> of increasing difficulty with a variety of materials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Then Float your Goat!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/52b6c6ff48627d12ba312a93f7bd9b3a.poster.avif?t=1755425431\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/52b6c6ff48627d12ba312a93f7bd9b3a.webm?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/52b6c6ff48627d12ba312a93f7bd9b3a.mp4?t=1755425431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail and voyage across the seas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Possibilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level can be completed in countless ways, have endless fun exploring multiple solutions and constructions for every level.</p>",
    "short_description": "He's a goat. He hates water. You're his only hope. In this physics puzzler, you'll build questionably-engineered rafts to guide your furry friend across vast waters. Master the art of buoyancy or traumatize a goat, what will it be?",
